    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.poster.avif?t=1755257283\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.webm?t=1755257283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.mp4?t=1755257283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a flower shop, design bouquets... with a talking flower on your head?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puni the Florist</strong> is a cozy flower shop simulation game where you play as &quot;Puni,&quot; an office worker-turned-florist. Run a flower shop, design bouquets, and deal with a weird talking flower in her shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill townsfolk\u2019s requests with your own floral designs using unique combinations of flowers and decorations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wholesome Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a silly, light-hearted, and relatable tale of self-discovery of Puni and the Flower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Floriography</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete flower collections and uncover the language of flowers through your scrapbook.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your shop your own with cute, customizable decor and personal touches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the Townsfolks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a quirky cast of characters, uncover their stories, and form lasting friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.poster.avif?t=1755257283\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.webm?t=1755257283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.mp4?t=1755257283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a flower shop, design bouquets... with a talking flower on your head?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puni the Florist</strong> is a cozy flower shop simulation game where you play as &quot;Puni,&quot; an office worker-turned-florist. Run a flower shop, design bouquets, and deal with a weird talking flower in her shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill townsfolk\u2019s requests with your own floral designs using unique combinations of flowers and decorations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wholesome Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a silly, light-hearted, and relatable tale of self-discovery of Puni and the Flower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Floriography</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete flower collections and uncover the language of flowers through your scrapbook.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your shop your own with cute, customizable decor and personal touches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the Townsfolks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a quirky cast of characters, uncover their stories, and form lasting friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Puni the Florist is a cozy flower shop simulation game that highlights creative expressions. Manage the shop, design unique bouquets, and join Puni on a silly, wholesome, and relatable journey of self-discovery.",
